,"author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3005185805/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3026098678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948#issuecomment-3026098678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107948","id":3026098678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc60Xpn2","user":{"login":"mellowminx","id":126353737,"node_id":"U_kgDOB4gBSQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126353737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx","html_url":"https://github.com/mellowminx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mellowminx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T02:05:00Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T02:05:00Z","body":"I excitedly downloaded Godot 4.5 beta 2 to test this fix, thank you so much! Working for me, tested for at least 30 mins each on iOS Chrome and iOS Safari. Test export is here: https://mellowminx.itch.io/audio-test-godot-45-beta2 (password: godot)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3026098678/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3034010254","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948#issuecomment-3034010254","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107948","id":3034010254,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6011KO","user":{"login":"Frozenfire92","id":5893112,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTMxMTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5893112?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92","html_url":"https://github.com/Frozenfire92","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Frozenfire92/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-04T00:28:25Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T00:28:25Z","body":"Does this change require a recompile? I'm wondering if its possible to fix for 4.4.1\r\n\r\nI tried copying the changes here in my two javascript files on my 4.4.1 export and it got further than before (and audio played), it still crashed/reloaded after about 30 seconds","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3034010254/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046482128","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948#issuecomment-3046482128","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107948","id":3046482128,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61laDQ","user":{"login":"PizzaLovers007","id":10912951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTEyOTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10912951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007","html_url":"https://github.com/PizzaLovers007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-07T20:48:32Z","updated_at":"2025-07-07T20:48:32Z","body":"> Does this change require a recompile? I'm wondering if its possible to fix for 4.4.1\r\n\r\nI don't believe so since the C++ <-> JS API didn't change, so it's likely there was an error copying the changes over.\r\n\r\nYou could try [building the web export templates](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.html#building-export-templates) at 4.4.1 with these changes to ensure the JS changes make it through properly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3046482128/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137942922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948#issuecomment-3137942922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107948","id":3137942922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67CTWK","user":{"login":"RumarioVR","id":176959461,"node_id":"U_kgDOCowv5Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176959461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR","html_url":"https://github.com/RumarioVR","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T22:02:15Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T22:02:15Z","body":"It looks like this change is causing ```get_playback_position()``` to return incorrect values in my WebXR app. I encountered this issue in version 4.5.beta4. In the last working WebXR version, 4.5.dev5, the bug never occurred (with the same code). Sometimes the deviations are 10 or 20 seconds. So, the song is just starting (you can hear it) and get_playback_position() returns 10.40xxx. I've taken a screenshot of this. I won't be able to create a sample project before Sunday, but I'm not doing anything more than that. I create and set the audio streams via code and load them as resources:\r\n```\r\naspSong.stream = ResourceLoader.load(path) # ogg- file\r\naspSong.play() # play some seconds then \r\naspSong.stop()\r\n```\r\nTo reproduce this, you should load a song and play it for a few seconds. Then load another one and play it again, and then the bug occurs. Usually after the second or thirg song you will get weird values\r\n![godot_bug_get_playback_position](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/04b96c5a-02c0-43bc-ab9f-5946a07cd6ed)\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3137942922/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3138027309","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948#issuecomment-3138027309","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107948","id":3138027309,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc67Cn8t","user":{"login":"RumarioVR","id":176959461,"node_id":"U_kgDOCowv5Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176959461?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR","html_url":"https://github.com/RumarioVR","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RumarioVR/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-30T22:39:31Z","updated_at":"2025-07-30T22:39:31Z","body":"You can even load and play the same song again. The error probably only occurs with playback_type = sample (which is the default value in the project settings for web projects). So, the error is so obvious that it should have been noticed during testing. So, it might be a different bug fix than this one. I just couldn't find any other thread besides this one.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3138027309/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263315250","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107948#issuecomment-3263315250","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107948","id":3263315250,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Cgj0y","user":{"login":"eduardomosko","id":62731713,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyNzMxNzEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62731713?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko","html_url":"https://github.com/eduardomosko","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eduardomosko/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-07T00:37:13Z","updated_at":"2025-09-07T00:38:31Z","body":"> > Does this change require a recompile? I'm wondering if its possible to fix for 4.4.1\r\n> \r\n> I don't believe so since the C++ <-> JS API didn't change, so it's likely there was an error copying the changes over.\r\n> \r\n> You could try [building the web export templates](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/compiling/compiling_for_web.html#building-export-templates) at 4.4.1 with these changes to ensure the JS changes make it through properly.\r\n\r\nThanks for the tip @PizzaLovers007. It worked like a charm. @Frozenfire92 if you haven't compiled it, this is everything I did:\r\n\r\n```sh\r\n# Install scons to build Godot\r\npip install SCons\r\n\r\n# Install and activate emscripten\r\ngit clone --depth 1 https://github.com/emscripten-core/emsdk.git\r\ncd emsdk\r\n\r\n./emsdk install latest\r\n./emsdk activate latest\r\nsource emsdk/emsdk_env.sh\r\n\r\ncd ..\r\n\r\n# Clone godot\r\ngit clone --depth 1 --branch 4.4.1-stable https://github.com/godotengine/godot.git\r\ncd godot\r\n\r\n# Get and apply only the patch\r\ngit fetch --depth 2 origin b58c6c829b9915bdd1d36f14d2ba96778f1f4dfc\r\ngit cherry-pick b58c6c829b9915bdd1d36f14d2ba96778f1f4dfc\r\n\r\n\r\n# Build only the templates I need\r\nscons platform=web target=template_release threads=no\r\nmv bin/*.zip ./web_nothreads_release.zip\r\n\r\nscons platform=web dlink_enabled=yes target=template_release threads=no\r\nmv bin/*.zip ./web_dlink_nothreads_release.zip\r\n\r\n# # Other ones that might be useful\r\n# scons platform=web target=template_release\r\n# mv bin/*.zip ./web_release.zip\r\n# \r\n# scons platform=web dlink_enabled=yes target=template_release\r\n# mv bin/*.zip ./web_dlink_release.zip\r\n# \r\n# # Debug ones\r\n# scons platform=web target=template_debug threads=no\r\n# mv bin/*.zip ./web_nothreads_debug.zip\r\n# \r\n# scons platform=web dlink_enabled=yes target=template_debug threads=no\r\n# mv bin/*.zip ./web_dlink_nothreads_debug.zip\r\n# \r\n# scons platform=web target=template_debug\r\n# mv bin/*.zip ./web_debug.zip\r\n# \r\n# scons platform=web dlink_enabled=yes target=template_debug\r\n# mv bin/*.zip ./web_dlink_debug.zip\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen you just gotta move the .zip files to Godot's export templates directory\r\n\r\nWould also be happy to send my build to anyone who needs it","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3263315250/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]